# Settings > General > "Sort threads by": Oldest first (Puffin 0.8.9). The
# catalog carries no creation time, so choosing it starts a walk that asks
# for each session's once (Client::session_created_at); rows it cannot answer
# for sit LAST; every answer is kept, so switching back and forth never asks
# again. Recent activity, the default, never walks at all.
#
# The mock's creation order is the REVERSE of its fixture order, which is
# roughly activity order, so the two sorts are told apart by t7/t6: t7 is
# busier, t6 is older. t8 is a session the "server" has no creation time for.
#
# env: HANABI_MOCK_CREATED_AT_UNKNOWN=t8
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":1500,"open_tabs":[],"active_tab":"","theme":"dark"}

wait_frames 20
# Default: recent activity, and no creation time asked for.
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t7 above chat_row_id_t6
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t8 above chat_row_id_t6
expect_mock_created_at_calls 0

# Choose Oldest first in Settings, then come back to the list.
click_ui sb_settings
wait_frames 10
expect_focused settings_search
type "sort threads"
wait_frames 8
expect_text "Sort threads by"
click_ui settings_result_0
wait_frames 8
click_ui settings_sort_order_1
wait_frames 30
key CMD+W
wait_frames 20

# Oldest first: the older t6 above the busier t7, and t8, whose creation time
# is unknown, below every row that has one.
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t6 above chat_row_id_t7
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_r5 above chat_row_id_t8
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t7 above chat_row_id_t8
expect_mock_created_at_calls 20

# Back to Recent activity: the old order, and no new asks...
click_ui sb_settings
wait_frames 10
type "sort threads"
wait_frames 8
click_ui settings_result_0
wait_frames 8
click_ui settings_sort_order_0
wait_frames 10
key CMD+W
wait_frames 20
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t7 above chat_row_id_t6
# ...and Oldest first again sorts from what is already known, asking nothing
# (t8 stays refused for this run rather than being re-asked every pass).
click_ui sb_settings
wait_frames 10
type "sort threads"
wait_frames 8
click_ui settings_result_0
wait_frames 8
click_ui settings_sort_order_1
wait_frames 10
key CMD+W
wait_frames 20
expect_ui_rel chat_row_id_t6 above chat_row_id_t7
expect_mock_created_at_calls 20
